# ── Setup Checklist ──────────────────────────────────────────
# Before going live, ensure you have:
# [x] 1. Run scripts/verify-rls.sql in Supabase SQL Editor
# [x] 2. Run scripts/set-super-admin.sql (replace email) in Supabase SQL Editor
# [x] 3. Run supabase/multi-tenant-core.sql in Supabase SQL Editor
# [x] 4. Run supabase/subscriptions-billing.sql in Supabase SQL Editor
# [x] 5. Set RAZORPAY_KEY_ID and RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET (live keys)
# [x] 6. Configure Razorpay webhook URL → /api/billing/webhook
# [x] 7. Set NEXT_PUBLIC_DEV_BYPASS_AUTH=false
# [x] 8. Configure Supabase email templates for invite emails
